    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73213" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring a burnt-offering, offer whole,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.8.4
			</span></i> : impf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡλοκαύτει</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτεῖται</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦται</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.9.1
			</span></i>:—more usu. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτ-όω</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡλοκαύτωσαν</span>
			v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.24
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτῶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					1.13.1
				</span></i>
			, etc. (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτοῦσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.694b
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοκαυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.9.1
				</span></i>
			, may belong to either form).</div>
